VERSION 120

EDIT UG_GATEWAY_MAIN_MENUBAR

AFTER UG_HELP

CASCADE_BUTTON NX2512_CONTROL_MENU
LABEL NX2512 Control
MESSAGE Codex local control commands for Siemens NX 2512.

END_OF_AFTER

MENU NX2512_CONTROL_MENU

BUTTON NX2512_CONTROL_START_BRIDGE

BUTTON NX2512_CONTROL_CREATE_TEST_PART

END_OF_MENU
